### Tags.

## Which input or operation was refused: the first words of the error.

tag-what-tag = tag
tag-what-name = tag name
tag-what-target = tag target
tag-what-message = tag message

## Why it was refused. A name or revision quoted in code is quoted in the
## argument.

tag-not-valid-name = { $name } is not a valid tag name
tag-names-no-commit = { $rev } does not name a commit
tag-exists = { $name } exists already
tag-message-nul = it has a NUL character in it
tag-message-empty = it is empty
tag-signed-needs-message = a signed tag needs a message
tag-not-created = { $name } was not created
tag-none = there is no tag { $name }
tag-moved = { $name } is not where this action left it; nothing was changed
tag-exists-again = { $name } exists again; nothing was changed
tag-target-gone = what { $name } pointed at is gone; nothing was changed
tag-has-message = { $name } has a message of its own already; nothing was changed
tag-not-annotated = { $name } was not annotated
